<p class="split-excerpt">A topic cluster is one main post and several shorter posts that link to it. How to plan one with a sheet of paper.</p>
</article>
<p class="split-read"><a class="button" href="/blog/planning-a-topic-cluster/">Read the whole issue</a></p>
